# Hual04a diagnostic route: six kills, earned card, bureau reader, fuse and installation.
# Diagnostic weapon grant: Beretta carried from Hual01b through Hual02 (see
# hual02_route.script's campaign-loadout note). Direct Hual04a login has no Beretta.
# No teleports, set_goal or take_control. Coordinates and times are Unreal units/seconds.
# Native #391 now permits the corpse timer to freeze its shadow. Continue the
# six-soldier death-event chain by input; do not infer the card counter from Timer.
# Carrington's sequence has not received its Degage start cue on this fixture.
# An additional input probe started it, but then waited for dernierpoint; the current
# DetectionVolume5 touch cylinder is below terrain along the measured approaches.
# Reinforcement SpawnActor fields stay None on the retained card/fuse route;
# installation case3 treats their bIsDead as false and enters FinDeMission. No reinforcement
# kill, cable-car lever activation or travel is claimed, and no remote named lever use occurs.
